# Same rule as the sibling Gradle fixture: build outputs and the third-party
# wrapper binary are not committed. Before a driven run:
#
#   gradle wrapper --gradle-version 9.5.1
#   ./gradlew classes
#
# The compile step is not optional here — Spring refuses metadata generation for
# a project with no compiled classes, with its own error message.
.gradle/
build/
gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
